message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "NovaFabric Flaky Detective"
abstract: >-
  An open-source agentic software-testing assistant for the UiPath platform that
  classifies a failing AI-agent test run as pass, flaky, or regression and pinpoints
  the differing step, by replaying and diffing a captured baseline run against the
  current run via NovaFabric.
type: software
